   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Structure of the passive with a modal verb",
     "texto": [
      "It consists of three elements: the **conjugated modal verb** in 2nd position and the final block formed by the **Partizip II + werden** in the infinitive:",
      "1. Main clause: **Der Bericht muss heute abgegeben werden** (the report must be handed in today / has to be handed in today).",
      "2. With other modals: **Das Gerät kann repariert werden** (the device can be repaired); **Die Datei darf nicht gelöscht werden** (the file may not be deleted / must not be deleted).",
      "3. In subordinate clauses (with **weil, dass**): the conjugated modal verb moves to the very end, after «werden»: **...weil der Termin verschoben werden muss**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
